al media reveals  plenty of fans who enjoyed his unique  energy and who were happy to see a new  take on the character an unexpected  thread amongst fans of bladders Joker  that he was too damn sexy in the role  the some film goers letter remains a  handsome man and no amount of grills or  wacky tattoos can take that away creepy  cutter another notch in the plus column  for letter as Joker the fact that he was  at times pretty chilling to watch  considering he wasn't even the main  villain he still managed a freak  audiences out making good use of his  limited screen time the last laugh Leto  hasn't yet reached icon status as the  Joker in Suicide Squad thanks to his  brief screen time and the mixed fans  reaction to his work in the role but it  wasn't a total wash either given a  little more time and material letter  could have still gone down as one of  fans favorite Joker's in cinematic  history this movie didn't do that for  him so maybe a turn as the resident  supervillain and Affleck standalone  feature is in order after all thanks for  watching subscribe to our YouTube  channel to watch more videos like the  one you just saw and leave us a comment  to let us know what you thought of Jared  Leto's Joker
 

